WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Of course the dead will not betray

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,980
It’s over. It’s not easy for us as a family of three.

3
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:09,980
When you and Wanwan are together

4
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:11,980
We really treat you as our own son

5
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:13,980
We have known each other for so many years

6
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:15,980
There are always feelings

7
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:16,980
spare us once

8
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:19,980
From now on, we will only recognize you as an orphan.

9
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:24,480
Brother Chuan, what do you want me to do?

10
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:25,480
I'll do whatever

11
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:27,480
Willing to do anything

12
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:28,480
As long as you are willing to let me stay

13
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:33,780
anything is OK

14
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:34,780
Then kill him

15
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:39,820
Ji Chuan, you can't do this
